        {
          "href": "/blog/tiktok-shop-originality-protection-image-evidence?lang=zh",
          "text": "2026 年 10 月 6 日\nTIKTOK-SHOP\n店铺运营\nTikTok Shop 原创保护：被抄图之前，先把图片证据链建好\n\n图片被复制前，先建立来源台账、权利链、证据包和平台回读。",
          "image": 880,
          "imageSrc": "https://www.weglobalmarketing.com/blog/thumbs/hero-tiktok-shop-originality-protection-image-evidence-zh-v1.jpg"
        },
        {
          "href": "/blog/tiktok-shop-customer-data-email-sms-marketing?lang=zh",
          "text": "2026 年 10 月 5 日\nTIKTOK-SHOP\n店铺运营\nTikTok Shop 客户数据能不能拿去做邮件或短信营销？\n\n购买不等于营销同意。按来源、用途、同意与证据判断邮件和短信用途。",
          "image": 880,
          "imageSrc": "https://www.weglobalmarketing.com/blog/thumbs/hero-tiktok-shop-customer-data-email-sms-marketing-zh-v1.jpg"
        },
        {
          "href": "/blog/tiktok-shop-agency-app-offboarding-data-access?lang=zh",
          "text": "2026 年 10 月 4 日\nTIKTOK-SHOP\n店铺运营\nTikTok Shop Agency 或 App 停止合作后，数据权限怎么真正收回来\n\n用盘点、撤销和独立回读，真正结束 Agency 或 App 的数据权限。",
          "image": 880,
          "imageSrc": "https://www.weglobalmarketing.com/blog/thumbs/hero-tiktok-shop-agency-app-offboarding-data-access-zh-v1.jpg"
